<title>Cost per task: Using cheap classifiers to route across Gemini models and thinking levels</title>
<link href="https://developers.googleblog.com/cost-per-task-using-cheap-classifiers-to-route-across-gemini-models-and-thinking-levels/"/>
<id>urn:rss-system-design:top3:ce5cc42203</id>
